The `get_available_algorithms` function first checks if the CSP API is initialized, then calls `csp_api_get_supported_algorithms` to get the list of supported algorithms. It then allocates memory for each algorithm structure and fills in the relevant fields. If there are any errors returned by the CSP API, it returns -2.

