To ensure scalability, the implementation caches the user roles for a short period of time to reduce the frequency of calls to the external service. The `UserRolesCache` class is responsible for caching and retrieving user roles. It uses a TTL (Time To Live) of 5 minutes by default, but this can be adjusted as needed.
